Let nums be a list of 1, 0, -1, and 2.
Let target be 2.
Sort nums.
Let last be the last position of nums.
For every first from 0 to last.
For every second from one more than first to last.
For every third from one more than second to last.
For every fourth from one more than third to last.
Let total be item first of nums plus item second of nums plus item third of nums plus item fourth of nums.
If total is target, print item first of nums, print item second of nums, print item third of nums, print item fourth of nums, print "---".
